@P05Shop.API_HostAddress = https://localhost:7127

### Lista prognoz (szablon)
GET {{P05Shop.API_HostAddress}}/api/weatherforecast
Accept: application/json

### Parametr z trasy
GET {{P05Shop.API_HostAddress}}/api/weatherforecast/3
Accept: application/json

### Parametry z query stringa
GET {{P05Shop.API_HostAddress}}/api/weatherforecast/search?days=4&minTemperature=10
Accept: application/json

### Query string zbindowany do obiektu
GET {{P05Shop.API_HostAddress}}/api/weatherforecast/filter?name=Warszawa&country=PL

### POST z JSON w treści – oczekujemy 201 Created i nagłówka Location
POST {{P05Shop.API_HostAddress}}/api/weatherforecast/cities
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kraków",
  "country": "PL"
}

### POST bez nazwy – oczekujemy 400 Bad Request
POST {{P05Shop.API_HostAddress}}/api/weatherforecast/cities
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "country": "PL"
}

### Produkty – lista (ServiceResponse z 100 produktami)
GET {{P05Shop.API_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Produkt o Id 1
GET {{P05Shop.API_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### Produkt, którego nie ma – 404 z komunikatem
GET {{P05Shop.API_HostAddress}}/api/products/9999
Accept: application/json
